== Notes ==
* This spell has a +6 bonus to the saving throw [[difficulty class|DC]].
* "Enemy spellcasters" is misleading, as all characters who fall under the "[[area of effect#Targeting|standard hostile]]" targeting scheme can have their associates dismissed. Thus, depending on the [[PvP setting|PvP]] and [[difficulty setting]]s, associates of party members &ndash; and even of this spell's caster &ndash; might be dismissed.
* This spell is the only one that can directly unsummon (as opposed to dispelling) the [[black blade of disaster (summon)|black blade of disaster]] (or any custom summons that are flagged as [[plot]]).
*The spell may be targeted within the described range and a visual effect will play at the target point, but the actual dismissal is centered on the caster, so creatures more than 10 meters away will not be affected.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''gate'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

